1
00:00:12,336 --> 00:00:17,876
D'ici vendredi, j'aurai terminé la première version du rapport.
By Friday, I'll have finished the first version of the report.

2
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:23,588
Dès que tu l'auras envoyée, je la relirai et je te donnerai mes remarques.
As soon as you've sent it, I'll reread it and give you my comments.

3
00:00:23,688 --> 00:00:30,572
Parfait. Quand nous aurons intégré tes remarques, nous l'enverrons au client.
Perfect. When we've included your comments, we'll send it to the client.

4
00:00:30,672 --> 00:00:36,260
Et le budget ? Il sera validé quand le chef aura signé ?
And the budget? Will it be approved when the boss has signed?

5
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:40,676
Oui, après qu'il aura reçu tous les devis.
Yes, after he has received all the quotes.

6
00:00:40,776 --> 00:00:46,532
Alors à la fin du mois, tout sera terminé, si tout se passe bien.
Then by the end of the month everything will be finished, if all goes well.
